"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/妖夢（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「どんなことですか？」","id":"FAE4D213-D3AE-45B6-8B10-E0839BD715DE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":1.2626077097505668},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.3051927437641724,"slideTitle":"スライド #508","title":"シーン 508","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_508_魂魄妖夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.508.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/妖夢（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_8FD3","characterName":"魂魄妖夢","telop":"「あなたは、魔理沙さんのここ\n最近の様子について知ってますか？」","id":"D64CEB9B-46CC-40FD-9351-F5B1D45D1B31","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"魂魄妖夢","voiceDuration":3.3051927437641724},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.8615192743764173,"slideTitle":"スライド #509","title":"シーン 509","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_509_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.509.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/妖夢（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「えっと…、特にはないです…」","id":"B56D75FD-2CEC-418D-8F99-2B26196B847F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":1.8615192743764173},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.159160997732426,"slideTitle":"スライド #510","title":"シーン 510","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_510_魂魄妖夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.510.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/妖夢（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_8FD3","characterName":"魂魄妖夢","telop":"「承知しました。突如の訪問にご対応いただきありがとうございました。これにて、私は失礼致します。」","id":"0D0A27C4-18E1-44E1-A88B-B9FEB3EEB68B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"魂魄妖夢","voiceDuration":6.159160997732426},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.926734693877551,"slideTitle":"スライド #511","title":"シーン 511","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_511_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.511.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそういうと、去っていった。\n僕は、ひとまず、リビングに戻る。","id":"53518AC8-3CD1-46B6-9EAD-B0511D911712","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":4.926734693877551},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.888684807256236,"slideTitle":"スライド #512","title":"シーン 512","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_512_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.512.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、食卓に座るとテレビをつける。\n僕は、その映像を見ているうちに、全身に痛みが走る。","id":"AB5C887E-7E9A-4BE5-9B0D-E9D882FC47F6","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.888684807256236},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.493038548752834,"slideTitle":"スライド #513","title":"シーン 513","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_513_サブ.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.513.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_CC3E","characterName":"サブ","telop":"そこには、ある女性が、街中にビームを撃ちまくる映像と、彼女との戦いに負けたのか、警察署で休む母が映っていた。","id":"A56D7F1C-22F8-4149-8E77-F35183D8852A","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"サブ","voiceDuration":8.493038548752834},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.02673469387755,"slideTitle":"スライド #514","title":"シーン 514","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_514_サブ.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.514.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_CC3E","characterName":"サブ","telop":"今、テレビで流れている映像を見ると、父とその女性が戦っている様子が流れていたが、父はビームを避けているだけだった。","id":"11D31D04-B758-4BE8-9C48-359B33C3E62C","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"サブ","voiceDuration":8.02673469387755},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.290861678004535,"slideTitle":"スライド #515","title":"シーン 515","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_515_サブ.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.515.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_CC3E","characterName":"サブ","telop":"きっと彼が、この映像をしっかりと目に焼き付ければ、冷静に考えて、母が映っていた警察署に向かうだろう。","id":"4443ACA0-6203-4CE4-9C19-B2BB530EF50C","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"サブ","voiceDuration":7.290861678004535},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.121292517006802,"slideTitle":"スライド #516","title":"シーン 516","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_516_サブ.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.516.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_CC3E","characterName":"サブ","telop":"「私は、どうすればいいのかな…」っと、そう呟きながら、ある覚悟を決め、準備を済ませると、その場所に向かった。","id":"1FF5FE21-BC0F-4ABB-B843-446E4CA79B66","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"サブ","voiceDuration":8.121292517006802},{"animationDuration":1.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"スライド #517","title":"シーン 517: その頃、ある場所では…","animationName":"なし","bgmVolume":0.65,"animationNote":"表示時間:1.5秒","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"単色背景","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.517.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","telop":"その頃、ある場所では…","id":"70743B55-1CFB-4392-BFE3-DD115811F253","seVolume":1},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":10.699478458049887,"slideTitle":"スライド #518","title":"シーン 518","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_518_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.518.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"私は、ふと部屋にある小さなテレビを見ていると、とある街中の生中継映像が流れた。私は、思わず、その映像に目を見張る。","id":"57E83324-F3A5-4D89-9E1F-04414D9F4F44","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":10.699478458049887},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":9.864489795918367,"slideTitle":"スライド #519","title":"シーン 519","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_519_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.519.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"その映像は、ビームを撃ち続ける女性と、それを避ける男性の様子が映されていた。そして、私は、ふと画面を注視する。","id":"5FAAB6B7-C9B8-45FC-9B7E-12E5455C82FA","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":9.864489795918367},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":9.899478458049886,"slideTitle":"スライド #520","title":"シーン 520","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_520_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.520.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"すると、一瞬だけ、どこかの警察署内で休んでいる巫女が映っていた。私は、そこでハッとし、お姉様の元に向かう。","id":"C31EEA68-47CD-4A83-BA39-1A7EF720894B","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":9.899478458049886},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.0194784580498866,"slideTitle":"スライド #521","title":"シーン 521","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_521_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.521.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（驚く）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「お姉様！」","id":"BA24B48F-00D2-4306-A6AF-E9123DDA069A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":1.0194784580498866},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.960907029478458,"slideTitle":"スライド #522","title":"シーン 522","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_522_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.522.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（驚く）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「どうしたのよ、フラン。そんな驚いた表情をして。」\n私は、そう妹に尋ねる。","id":"8005A2F3-401B-4EEA-BDA7-D213F555535A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":5.960907029478458},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.0463265306122445,"slideTitle":"スライド #523","title":"シーン 523","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_523_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.523.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（驚く）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"すると、彼女は衝撃的な内容を語りだす。\n私は、その内容を聞くと、ある人物に電話をかける。","id":"3C31AB0B-EC94-4E96-919B-55683A55939D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":7.0463265306122445},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.1374829931972785,"slideTitle":"スライド #524","title":"シーン 524","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_524_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.524.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"私は、職員室で作業をしていると、突如として電話が鳴る。\n私は、鳴り響く電話の受話器を取るとある声が聞こえた。","id":"20C10490-6042-4B57-8E81-873ACD5782BC","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voiceDuration":7.1374829931972785},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.10469387755102,"slideTitle":"スライド #525","title":"シーン 525","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_525_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.525.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"「お嬢様、その慌てた口調、何かあったんですか？」\n私は、その電話の声…レミリアに尋ねる。","id":"3189B780-9824-4D69-9F3D-47CA87775CCC","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voiceDuration":6.10469387755102},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.3171655328798186,"slideTitle":"スライド #526","title":"シーン 526","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_526_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.526.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「咲夜、今すぐテレビをつけなさい。」","id":"7D443E8C-B346-4013-8F44-8489F0E37C64","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":2.3171655328798186},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.619886621315192,"slideTitle":"スライド #527","title":"シーン 527","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_527_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.527.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"私は、お嬢様にそう言われ、テレビをつける。すると、そこには衝撃的な映像が流れていた。「これは、どういうことですか？」","id":"32428C71-44F4-466A-A327-01306732239F","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voiceDuration":7.619886621315192},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.521315192743764,"slideTitle":"スライド #528","title":"シーン 528","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_528_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.528.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「説明している時間は、ないわ。とにかく、その場所に、誰かを急行させて、騒ぎを鎮静化させなさい。そうじゃないと…」","id":"7935F1FA-08A7-4259-BECC-BA13AE2609F6","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":8.521315192743764},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.43968253968254,"slideTitle":"スライド #529","title":"シーン 529","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_529_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.529.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"私は、お嬢様からの命令を聞き、\n電話を終えると、ある部屋に電話をかける。","id":"BCB90B69-504F-4440-A414-79F7A3DD5C59","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voiceDuration":4.43968253968254},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.587074829931973,"slideTitle":"スライド #530","title":"シーン 530","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_530_美鈴.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.530.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_21A0","characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「もしもし、こんな時間に電話をかけて、どうしたんですか？」","id":"C94FAEC0-CF7D-47C3-B7DF-C578F5B38BAA","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voiceDuration":2.587074829931973},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.724285714285714,"slideTitle":"スライド #531","title":"シーン 531","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_531_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.531.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"私は、そう聞く彼女に、お嬢様からの電話の内容を伝える。","id":"4762534D-6E03-4761-8D95-4E70CAC33A57","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voiceDuration":3.724285714285714},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.269501133786848,"slideTitle":"スライド #532","title":"シーン 532","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_532_美鈴.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.532.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_21A0","characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「そうですか…、分かりました。」","id":"E7D1F70F-6222-420E-87B3-02F0A00B906B","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voiceDuration":1.269501133786848},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.063877551020408,"slideTitle":"スライド #533","title":"シーン 533","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_533_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.533.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"私は、電話が切れると、お嬢様の家電にかける。","id":"0D625F23-AC54-4BAD-96F5-367144313E38","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voiceDuration":3.063877551020408},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.029659863945578,"slideTitle":"スライド #534","title":"シーン 534","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_534_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.534.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（驚く）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"私は、咲夜との通話を終えると、フランにいう。\n「フラン、今すぐに彼が今どこにいるか、探して来なさい。」","id":"7E32699F-62D8-4688-9E10-73319ACABC6B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":7.029659863945578},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.430748299319728,"slideTitle":"スライド #535","title":"シーン 535","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_535_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.535.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/困り顔小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「分かった。じゃあ、彼を探してくるね…」","id":"05FDCD0D-0C34-4A6E-94D9-F1A2FE31078E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":3.430748299319728},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.479478458049886,"slideTitle":"スライド #536","title":"シーン 536","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_536_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.536.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/困り顔小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「フラン、しっかりと彼を見つけ出して、守って見せなさい、彼がその場所で倒れる前に、いいとこ見せて来なさい。」","id":"39CA5698-B53D-47F9-8512-54289D15CC89","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":8.479478458049886},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.4982312925170067,"slideTitle":"スライド #537","title":"シーン 537","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_537_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.537.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/フラン（笑い）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「うん、わかった！」","id":"C9443073-B308-48D8-9A21-029BCACD0017","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":1.4982312925170067},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.543650793650794,"slideTitle":"スライド #538","title":"シーン 538","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_538_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.538.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"フランが、そう言って去ると、私は「はぁ」とため息をつく。\nそして、同時に、これがきっかけで二人が…と考えるのだった。","id":"F6AB0A98-D917-4B43-9384-ECE1001BD717","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":8.543650793650794},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.34954648526077,"slideTitle":"スライド #539","title":"シーン 539","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_539_サブ.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.539.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/霧雨魔理沙7.jpg","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_CC3E","characterName":"サブ","telop":"私が、テレビに映っていた場所に来ると、そこでは、彼女が箒に跨って空を飛び回りながら、ビームを周囲に放っていた。","id":"E66496A8-114D-4B8A-8B22-94A10D3DA0F1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"サブ","voiceDuration":8.34954648526077},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.050634920634921,"slideTitle":"スライド #540","title":"シーン 540","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_540_サブ.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.540.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/妹紅（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_CC3E","characterName":"サブ","telop":"そして、ふと周りを見ると、父が困惑しながら、\nひたすらにそのビームを避けている様子だった。","id":"04136A1D-BC60-41E3-8BDD-7FC51E8DF227","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"サブ","voiceDuration":6.050634920634921},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.961519274376418,"slideTitle":"スライド #541","title":"シーン 541","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_541_サブ.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.541.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_CC3E","characterName":"サブ","telop":"すると、ふと空腹を体が訴えてくる。今ここで、夕飯を食べて仕舞えば、きっと彼が戻ってくる。そうはさせたくはなかった。","id":"09614E17-310F-4C34-9328-69E2EA8A474C","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"サブ","voiceDuration":8.961519274376418},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.574557823129251,"slideTitle":"スライド #542","title":"シーン 542","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_542_サブ.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.542.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_CC3E","characterName":"サブ","telop":"だが、空腹に抗えるわけでもなく、私はある飲食店に入った。","id":"CC6C1711-46CA-428F-97E6-B043C429A69A","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"サブ","voiceDuration":4.574557823129251},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.546303854875283,"slideTitle":"スライド #543","title":"シーン 543","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_543_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.543.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/妹紅（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「んっ…」僕は、ふと気がつくと、そこは夜の街中だった。\nそして、ふと周りを見渡していると、魔理沙さんと父が見える。","id":"A6CFD666-987F-403F-867A-7319615C8420","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.546303854875283},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.690430839002268,"slideTitle":"スライド #544","title":"シーン 544","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_544_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.544.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/妹紅（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"ふともう一度見ると、魔理沙さんはビームを父やビルに向かって乱射するように放ち、父はそれを困った表情で避けていた。","id":"BA3F2E05-5DD6-45D7-865B-E3E247F5DEC4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.690430839002268},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.887596371882086,"slideTitle":"スライド #545","title":"シーン 545","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_545_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.545.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、後ろから僕の肩が叩かれる。その方向に振り向くと、この前、夜の学校の廊下で会った女性だった。「こんばんは。」","id":"1348423B-FD1D-4AF1-845D-59B1D5FD704E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.887596371882086},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.486984126984127,"slideTitle":"スライド #546","title":"シーン 546","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_546_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.546.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/フラン（笑い）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「こんばんは。こんなところで、どうしたの？」","id":"2A882465-B424-43FD-9F0B-830ACE3E4063","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":3.486984126984127},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.307165532879819,"slideTitle":"スライド #547","title":"シーン 547","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_547_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.547.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「えっと…」僕はそう言い、なぜ自分がこんな場所に来たかを思い出そうとするが、思い出せない。「分からないです…」","id":"B7EC893C-575D-49D5-B85F-4B4F546AA5D8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.307165532879819},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.814489795918368,"slideTitle":"スライド #548","title":"シーン 548","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_548_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.548.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「そう、それより、あなたは、これから、何かの予定はある？」","id":"A899FE3E-9802-4C9C-8BD4-3078BA00A614","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":4.814489795918368},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.4049886621315193,"slideTitle":"スライド #549","title":"シーン 549","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_549_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.549.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「えっと…ないです…」","id":"C35A274D-5934-4455-A8A6-43B23367FB64","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":1.4049886621315193},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.176984126984127,"slideTitle":"スライド #550","title":"シーン 550","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_550_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.550.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/フラン（笑い）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「そう、なら私と一緒に、夜の街を歩いてみない？」","id":"F940DC55-4EBB-4D78-B3C4-D2E638732BDC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":4.176984126984127},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.824557823129251,"slideTitle":"スライド #551","title":"シーン 551","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_551_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.551.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/フラン（笑い）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「えっと…」僕は、彼女からの誘いに、どう返そうか考えていると、誰かがビルに激突し、僕はその方を見る。","id":"8BEF1DCA-BEC6-4D69-A24C-5F291DBE93B9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.824557823129251},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.67249433106576,"slideTitle":"スライド #552","title":"シーン 552","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_552_藤原妹紅.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.552.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/妹紅（弱る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_DF97","characterName":"藤原妹紅","telop":"「痛てぇ…、ついよそ見をしちまったぜ…」私は、彼女からのビームが来ているのにも関わらず、逆ナンを受けている息子を見た。","id":"F84C1109-D642-43F7-9C16-8E34BB10F034","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"藤原妹紅","voiceDuration":7.67249433106576},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.4594784580498867,"slideTitle":"スライド #553","title":"シーン 553","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_553_霧雨魔理沙.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideI