夢（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「あっ、あんた、一体どんな夢見てたら、母親の…」","id":"CEFAEE90-68DD-40EE-A1DB-78392895BF22","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":4.3244897959183675},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/E1D3751D-BB7F-53CF-9E90-C078A5AB6FC6.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.436507936507937,"slideTitle":"スライド #677","title":"シーン 677","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_677_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"E1D3751D-BB7F-53CF-9E90-C078A5AB6FC6.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.677.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/霊夢（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「なんとなく感じてた、あの感触は…」\n僕は、そこで、気付いてはいけないような事実に気づく。","id":"3E9933B2-A51A-44DB-BABD-0D779B80845C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.436507936507937},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/E1D3751D-BB7F-53CF-9E90-C078A5AB6FC6.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.296984126984127,"slideTitle":"スライド #678","title":"シーン 678","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_678_博麗霊夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"E1D3751D-BB7F-53CF-9E90-C078A5AB6FC6.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.678.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"