方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"そして、魔理沙が家に来る前に取り出した、息子の部屋にあった書類や荷物、そして過去の記録物を取り出し、中身を確認する。","id":"A14A1772-C7DD-4B6A-9352-9AE31983D47D","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":9.786984126984127},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.685736961451248,"slideTitle":"スライド #784","title":"シーン 784","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_784_博麗霊夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.784.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"その中身にある文字と、婚姻届の文字を比較する。どうやら、彼が書いたわけではなかった。「もしかしたら…」","id":"C0728986-B498-4CA5-969F-446B46AE8D94","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":8.685736961451248},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":11.076984126984128,"slideTitle":"スライド #785","title":"シーン 785","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_785_博麗霊夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.785.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"私は、取り出した書類や荷物の中から、入念深く探す。すると、あるものを見つける。その文字と婚姻届の文字は似通っていた。","id":"B58DE3E8-5FA8-411D-B1D6-E7996F03EE6A","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":11.076984126984128},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":10.145736961451247,"slideTitle":"スライド #786","title":"シーン 786","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_786_博麗霊夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.786.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","characterName":"博麗霊夢","telop":"私は、そこで気づく。いつの間にか、彼は、この家からいなくなったんだと。そして、時計を見ると、今日は土曜日だった。","id":"4736AFC7-CA70-495F-8A7F-2867D117C9AE","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":10.145736961451247},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.428911564625851,"slideTitle":"スライド #787","title":"シーン 787","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_787_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.787.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、ふと気がつくと、そこはフランと僕の二人部屋だった。\nすると、扉が、突如として開き、誰かが入ってくる。","id":"633A7FC4-8AFC-4C05-9F22-A79BAC263FEB","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.428911564625851},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.786984126984127,"slideTitle":"スライド #788","title":"シーン 788","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_788_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.788.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（余裕）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「あら、目が覚めたの、紅夢くん…。」","id":"4A6DD8B3-29B6-4B81-8E98-C928023A0D33","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":2.786984126984127},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.3778231292517,"slideTitle":"スライド #789","title":"シーン 789","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_789_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.789.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（余裕）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はふと、彼女の吐息が酒臭いことに気がつく。「…フランさん、どれだけお酒を飲みましたか？」","id":"FBBE27E0-4A22-4CFB-9937-767CD77C2D07","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.3778231292517},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.1539002267573695,"slideTitle":"スライド #790","title":"シーン 790","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_790_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.790.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（余裕）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕がそう尋ねるが、返答はなく、\n代わりに彼女は僕をベッドの上に押し倒す。","id":"7163C14F-6962-4692-BCA2-D170745F3558","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":5.1539002267573695},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":9.634489795918368,"slideTitle":"スライド #791","title":"シーン 791","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_791_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.791.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（余裕）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「そんなことよりも…」私はそう言いながら、服を動かし、彼に下着と生身をチラ見せする。「どう、先生といいことしない？」","id":"36B846C4-BC85-4490-866A-BDE2191CCFCC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":9.634489795918368},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.80390022675737,"slideTitle":"スライド #792","title":"シーン 792","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_792_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.792.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/後ろ手口閉じ目閉じ.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「でも…僕は…」僕は彼女をそう制止させようとするが、そう言いかける口を彼女は、そっと口付けをして封じてくる。","id":"BD1C5C67-20DF-444D-A909-CD372DFE5994","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.80390022675737},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.406984126984127,"slideTitle":"スライド #793","title":"シーン 793","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_793_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.793.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（余裕）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「どう、このまま先生に身を任せてくれない？」","id":"2BA32A6A-56DF-42B8-BAC6-7B3A906E28BB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":3.406984126984127},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.70172335600907,"slideTitle":"スライド #794","title":"シーン 794","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_794_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.794.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（余裕）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はそう言われ、一瞬断ろうかと思ったが、雰囲気的に難しいと感じ、全身の力を抜いて、脱力する。「それじゃあ…」","id":"6CA8FA93-1983-4862-BCF4-ECBF69CC7FA8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.70172335600907},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.426984126984127,"slideTitle":"スライド #795","title":"シーン 795","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_795_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.795.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（余裕）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「ありがとう、それじゃあ、気持ち良くしてあげる。」\n私はそういい、彼の服を脱がすと、自らも服を脱いだ。","id":"68BD1A1C-CF1F-4169-B635-3CEE1EA3C5AE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":8.426984126984127},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.532154195011338,"slideTitle":"スライド #796","title":"シーン 796","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_796_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.796.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「んっ…」僕はふと目が覚めると、窓から朝日が差し込んでいた。そして、ふとある違和感を感じ、隣を見る。","id":"51D75B72-61BE-4C66-B677-B00067DEC784","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.532154195011338},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.685419501133786,"slideTitle":"スライド #797","title":"シーン 797","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_797_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.797.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、隣を見た瞬間に、裸のフランを見てしまい、さっとベッドから飛び出る。そして、ふと手元を見ると僕も裸だった。","id":"EEA4C76E-B96F-43E3-8363-DC94575C4BA5","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.685419501133786},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.60172335600907,"slideTitle":"スライド #798","title":"シーン 798","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_798_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.798.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、服を着るということが抜け落ちたまま、あたふたしていると、突如として扉をノックされ、レミリアの声が聞こえる。","id":"D34C580A-AB10-46B5-976D-2A0D7D3BAAFB","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.60172335600907},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.7713151927437645,"slideTitle":"スライド #799","title":"シーン 799","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_799_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.799.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「もう起きてるの、二人とも？起きているなら、返事をしなさい。じゃないと、勝手に扉を開けるわよ。」","id":"C2BB7666-4B12-445D-B0C7-6B62ABE5CD47","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":6.7713151927437645},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":9.348027210884354,"slideTitle":"スライド #800","title":"シーン 800","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_800_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.800.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、ふとフランの方を見ると、彼女は依然として裸のまますやすやと眠っていた。僕は、そのまま戸惑っていると、扉が開く。","id":"5B58DE66-0258-4B57-9E34-540604CB2231","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":9.348027210884354},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.769115646258504,"slideTitle":"スライド #801","title":"シーン 801","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_801_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.801.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/驚き.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、部屋に入ってきた彼女は、みるみるうちに頬を赤く染めていた。「あの…レミリアさん…僕は…どうすれば…」","id":"A3CFB2A9-54F3-49BA-ADE1-9F048A535D6E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.769115646258504},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.1317460317460317,"slideTitle":"スライド #802","title":"シーン 802","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_802_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.802.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「とりあえず、服を着たらどうなの？」","id":"B1F05C91-DB6D-401F-99BE-66815C1CF361","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":2.1317460317460317},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.243038548752834,"slideTitle":"スライド #803","title":"シーン 803","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_803_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.803.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう指摘され、自分が裸のままであることに気づく。そして、ベッドの下に服があり、それを取って切る。","id":"86F8B44A-1441-4A5F-B93B-390383ABCC7B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.243038548752834},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.787981859410431,"slideTitle":"スライド #804","title":"シーン 804","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_804_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.804.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「とりあえず、私は食堂に戻るから、あなたもフランを起こして、ささっと食堂に来なさい、そこでこの件は話しましょう。」","id":"7E7EC864-643C-4795-9C4D-DA898C3434AA","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":7.787981859410431},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.465850340136054,"slideTitle":"スライド #805","title":"シーン 805","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_805_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.805.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそういうと、部屋をさっていった。\nそれから、静けさが部屋に戻ると、フランが目を覚ます。","id":"D260DD08-0968-4ACF-8AC6-FF124A361611","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.465850340136054},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":0.6419954648526077,"slideTitle":"スライド #806","title":"シーン 806","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_806_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.806.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/寝起き顔.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「んっ…」","id":"BE311CDE-FB4F-4F93-B195-084B4E2B616F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":0.6419954648526077},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.549478458049887,"slideTitle":"スライド #807","title":"シーン 807","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_807_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.807.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/寝起き小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「あれ…ここは…」\n私は、そう言いながら、だんだんと頭が冴えてくる。","id":"7CDCB790-929F-4119-A419-8FADDF896930","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":5.549478458049887},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.528231292517007,"slideTitle":"スライド #808","title":"シーン 808","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_808_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.808.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「紅夢くん…昨日はごめんなさい、真夜中に襲いかかって…」","id":"654759D0-1816-4B65-A09D-4244E373753B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":4.528231292517007},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.306077097505669,"slideTitle":"スライド #809","title":"シーン 809","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_809_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.809.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「それより、服を着てくれませんか…？」","id":"D14106CB-27E1-43AA-BD0C-1C2F2CF5CF05","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":2.306077097505669},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.7044897959183674,"slideTitle":"スライド #810","title":"シーン 810","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_810_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.810.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「とりあえず、着替えるから、部屋から出てくれない？」","id":"1ACBAD98-A99E-4A49-8F25-29FFCD4760F5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":3.7044897959183674},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.686507936507937,"slideTitle":"スライド #811","title":"シーン 811","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_811_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.811.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「分かりました…、着替えたら食堂に来てください。僕は、先に食堂に向かっているので。」僕はそういうと、部屋を離れた。","id":"FE33D7AE-52EA-40C4-A103-4D6A67B2A7B7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.686507936507937},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.30390022675737,"slideTitle":"スライド #812","title":"シーン 812","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_812_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.812.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、それから食堂に来ると、すでに朝食の準備ができていた。","id":"9B8F393F-B417-4F6A-9102-37C3741F724E","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":4.30390022675737},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.0908616780045355,"slideTitle":"スライド #813","title":"シーン 813","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_813_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.813.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、10分程度でフランもやってくる。\nすると、挨拶を済ますと、3人で朝食を食べ始めた。","id":"A548CF03-DAE7-4198-BD08-122D4748226B","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.0908616780045355},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.085895691609977,"slideTitle":"スライド #814","title":"シーン 814","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_814_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.814.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「それで、〇〇を卒業した気分を教えてくれるかしら、紅夢。」","id":"EAC79B3B-3664-4CA4-84D0-FC5799D1E2E4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":4.085895691609977},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.099546485260771,"slideTitle":"スライド #815","title":"シーン 815","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_815_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.815.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「あの、〇〇ってなんですか…？」\n僕は、フランが頬照りながら驚いている姿を見ながらいう。","id":"C2323741-49F2-486D-827E-EA70B7D8A97E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.099546485260771},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.6484126984126983,"slideTitle":"スライド #816","title":"シーン 816","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_816_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.816.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「こんなこと言わなくてもわかるでしょ。それで、どうなの？」","id":"0884D859-7B30-4037-BF0D-41D04FDE6F8A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":3.6484126984126983},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.819115646258504,"slideTitle":"スライド #817","title":"シーン 817","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_817_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.817.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、そういうとレミリアの表情と今までの会話から、その言葉の意味を推測する。「フランさんならわかると思いますが…」","id":"4D7EBE56-A6E7-49C2-ACC8-F6E4C94C0703","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.819115646258504},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.05281179138322,"slideTitle":"スライド #818","title":"シーン 818","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_818_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.818.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（驚く）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから僕が二人に告げた、ある内容に二人は驚くのだった。","id":"C2617547-5CC7-4888-8252-97F1FF31048D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":4.05281179138322},{"animationDuration":1.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"スライド #819","title":"シーン 819: それから…","animationName":"なし","bgmVolume":0.65,"animationNote":"表示時間:1.5秒","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"単色背景","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.819.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから…","id":"00D7E72B-D3C5-4208-AE6E-967EAE73C42A","seVolume":1},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.723469387755102,"slideTitle":"スライド #820","title":"シーン 820","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_820_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.820.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、僕は、朝食を食べ終えて、身支度を整えると、フランに図書館の場所を聞いて、やってきた。そしてある本を探す。","id":"F4D4D55D-C940-4AF1-AC4E-C276FC1FDD46","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.723469387755102},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/04039E1E-32B0-5CF7-8D5F-42290235463E.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.591950113378685,"slideTitle":"スライド #821","title":"シーン 821","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_821_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"04039E1E-32B0-5CF7-8D5F-42290235463E.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.821.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、目的の本がありそうな棚を見つけ、その棚をはじから見ていく。「あった。」僕はそう言い、その本を取り出し戻る。","id":"E8343659-6D90-4A45-938D-E6B2A7B8B4B3","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.591950113378685},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.318027210884354,"slideTitle":"スライド #822","title":"シーン 822","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_822_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.822.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、取り出した本は、「全国財閥高統一模試」の過去問集だった。そして、フランにもらった新品のノートを開く。","id":"5A1C3DC6-88BC-4240-9FCE-48E7B19802B0","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.318027210884354},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.370204081632654,"slideTitle":"スライド #823","title":"シーン 823","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_823_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.823.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そこから、僕は遠足の2週間前に受ける、その試験に向けた勉強を黙々と、この大規模な図書館で進めていくのだった。","id":"AF3DE9D1-2FBA-4E14-BC07-A9D9203BBB7F","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.370204081632654},{"animationDuration":1.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"スライド #824","title":"シーン 824: 一方でフランとレミリアは…","animationName":"なし","bgmVolume":0.65,"animationNote":"表示時間:1.5秒","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"単色背景","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.824.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","telop":"一方でフランとレミリアは…","id":"20B3B599-45D5-4B8A-9CF4-965F8B3216C5","seVolume":1},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.1046485260770975,"slideTitle":"スライド #825","title":"シーン 825","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_825_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.825.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/疑問顔.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「ねぇ、フラン。」","id":"E01E356F-C105-47A6-A266-AC41FD3273D3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":1.1046485260770975},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.6844897959183673,"slideTitle":"スライド #826","title":"シーン 826","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_826_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.826.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/疑問顔.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「なに、お姉様？」","id":"27B348BA-CAD9-4CB8-8E3E-9E86209649A7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":1.6844897959183673},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.3150793650793653,"slideTitle":"スライド #827","title":"シーン 827","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_827_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.827.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/疑問顔.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「フランは、昨晩の飲み会、どこまで覚えてるの？」","id":"983DD2D3-712E-4500-9105-10E09E801C1D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":3.3150793650793653},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.715736961451247,"slideTitle":"スライド #828","title":"シーン 828","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_828_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.828.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/困り顔小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「えっと…」私はそう言われ、記憶を遡る。","id":"D7C5093A-4B15-431D-B867-EFA83911601C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":3.715736961451247},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc228271_居酒屋の個室.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":9.090748299319728,"slideTitle":"スライド #829","title":"シーン 829","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_829_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc228271_居酒屋の個室.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.829.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"昨晩、彼女が図書館に行った後、私とお姉様は、もともとこの屋敷に住んでいた咲夜たちとの飲み会に向かった。","id":"AA72CAC5-6108-452A-B631-59BA853AFC6C","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":9.090748299319728},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc228271_居酒屋の個室.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.951995464852608,"slideTitle":"スライド #830","title":"シーン 830","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_830_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc228271_居酒屋の個室.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.830.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/パチュリー（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"すると、始まってからすぐに、パチュリーが私に、祝いの言葉を告げる。その後、順々に言葉を聞き終えていく。","id":"CB187C24-24DE-4AFF-8BB4-2F722176718E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":8.951995464852608},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc228271_居酒屋の個室.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.616984126984127,"slideTitle":"スライド #831","title":"シーン 831","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_831_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc228271_居酒屋の個室.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.831.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/パチュリー（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"私は、彼女たちからの祝いの言葉に少し困惑する。\nなぜなら、彼との結婚が決まったわけではないからだ。","id":"88015133-37BB-458C-A5BD-0D7D2FE32AC1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":8.616984126984127},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.709478458049887,"slideTitle":"スライド #832","title":"シーン 832","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_832_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"咲夜（困る）.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.832.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"すると、咲夜が私になぜ、困っているかを聞いてくる。\n私が戸惑っていると、お姉様がそのことを伝える。","id":"DE1A71DB-F538-461B-8028-7FF097D195E2","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":8.709478458049887},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（弱る）.png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.839478458049887,"slideTitle":"スライド #833","title":"シーン 833","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_833_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"咲夜（弱る）.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.833.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"その言葉に皆は、謝り、少しばかし空気が暗くなりかけてたところに、赤ワインとお通しが出てくる。","id":"E85CD4E6-FB51-4015-AD7D-2814BA61CC0D","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":7.839478458049887},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（弱る）.png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":9.334489795918367,"slideTitle":"スライド #834","title":"シーン 834","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_834_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"咲夜（弱る）.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.834.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"そして、それからしばらく経つと、お酒だけ飲んでいた私とお姉様は…、私はその先を思い出そうとするが、思い出せない。","id":"30532810-9CB9-4A4A-9DA1-FDEC31DD5BBB","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":9.334489795918367},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.692154195011338,"slideTitle":"スライド #835","title":"シーン 835","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_835_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.835.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「確かに、あの時は、私とフランだけすでに食事を済ませて、酒だけをのが、原因なのは分かっている、けど…」","id":"B989ADBE-85DC-420E-8C0C-FAD25D199B98","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":7.692154195011338},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.073401360544218,"slideTitle":"スライド #836","title":"シーン 836","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_836_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.836.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「私がフランにいう資格は、ないかもしれないけど、少しばかし、アルコールの自己管理くらい、出来たらどうかしら？」","id":"64F10879-9ED9-44EB-AB7A-1CDB141B47A6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":7.073401360544218},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":9.454489795918366,"slideTitle":"スライド #837","title":"シーン 837","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_837_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.837.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"私は、お姉様の指摘通りなので、頭を抱えて考える。だが、だんだんとオーバヒートしているような感覚がしてくる。","id":"EFB85796-3D99-43AE-BAC5-9FCF5A3BDFE7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":9.454489795918366},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.7588208616780046,"slideTitle":"スライド #838","title":"シーン 838","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_838_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.838.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（狂気）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"私はそこで、「しまった」とつぶやく。だが、\nそう呟いている間にも、フランはこちらに攻撃をしてくる。","id":"94130A7A-F708-4648-9988-7B4A3AC2CE44","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":6.7588208616780046},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.6754875283446715,"slideTitle":"スライド #839","title":"シーン 839","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_839_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.839.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（狂気）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"私は、彼女の攻撃を避けながら、あるものを探す。\nすると、ハッと思い出し、その場所に向かい、疾走する。","id":"1B8F260C-EF1F-43FA-8D93-0ED207AD47D0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":7.6754875283446715},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.571315192743764,"slideTitle":"スライド #840","title":"シーン 840","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_840_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.840.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（狂気）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"そして、フランの攻撃を避けながら、なんとか取り出したそれを、フランの攻撃の隙をつき、ぷつっと刺す。","id":"F0D0FD95-C73F-4DEA-9415-20ECF940CE2D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":6.571315192743764},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.2632426303854873,"slideTitle":"スライド #841","title":"シーン 841","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_841_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.841.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/疑問顔.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「あれ…今私は、なにしてたんだっけ？」","id":"14E9B314-933C-4FF2-BD6F-A29706AE2630","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":3.2632426303854873},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.3192290249433105,"slideTitle":"スライド #842","title":"シーン 842","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_842_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.842.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/疑問顔.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「とりあえず、彼のいる図書館に行ってきたらどうかしら？」","id":"83700005-36E3-47EE-9F0C-344E77019CB6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":3.3192290249433105},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.4244897959183676,"slideTitle":"スライド #843","title":"シーン 843","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_843_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.843.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「じゃあ、図書館にいってくるね。」","id":"CAB3BD95-AC7C-47E3-97AD-1DF4E32B5234","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":2.4244897959183676},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.651995464852607,"slideTitle":"スライド #844","title":"シーン 844","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_844_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.844.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"フランはそういうと去っていった。\nそして、私は先ほど使用したそれをみる。","id":"7DD6BB3E-03B8-4815-870E-DC7A5180E31D","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":4.651995464852607},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":9.112403628117914,"slideTitle":"スライド #845","title":"シーン 845","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_845_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.845.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"これは、注射器で、その中には、ある人物の血液が入っていた。\nその人物は、今、彼が元いた家に住んでいる女性のものだった。","id":"DCDF0377-650E-4DA2-807E-341FFBD5FFCA","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":9.112403628117914},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.246326530612246,"slideTitle":"スライド #846","title":"シーン 846","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_846_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.846.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「どっかのタイミングで、彼から採血しないとね…」特殊な体を持つ二人の血液は、フランの狂気を瞬時に、鎮静化できた。","id":"0650DD5A-B6E3-47BB-960A-3908C69AE682","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":8.246326530612246},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.715079365079365,"slideTitle":"スライド #847","title":"シーン 847","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_847_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.847.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"このことを知るまでは、フランの狂気を肉弾戦で食い止めるか、一瞬の隙をついて気絶させるかの二択しかなかったのだった。","id":"F599696C-C8A9-4C47-9CF9-577FC5EEE4CB","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":7.715079365079365},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.746326530612245,"slideTitle":"スライド #848","title":"シーン 848","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_848_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.848.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"彼とその女性には、狂気というものは存在しないが、別の要素を持っていた。この流れは、今後も続くかもしれない。","id":"BAD4D510-1D2A-42B2-869C-94ED4D0DC4DF","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":7.746326530612245},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.481156462585034,"slideTitle":"スライド #849","title":"シーン 849","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_849_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.849.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"私は、それを見ながら、そんなことを考えるのだった。","id":"B3485382-4791-4BF0-8A7C-E84FC300FA45","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":3.481156462585034},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.6191156462585035,"slideTitle":"スライド #850","title":"シーン 850","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_850_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.850.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕が、図書館で勉強していると、フランがやってくる。","id":"AC409191-1258-4E2C-93CF-1C986ADE4862","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.6191156462585035},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.161995464852608,"slideTitle":"スライド #851","title":"シーン 851","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_851_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.851.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「何をしているの？」\n作成者：zuyasi","id":"EAB12158-94B2-46C3-8C7B-05D81D2F3C56","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":4.161995464852608},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.1865079365079363,"slideTitle":"スライド #852","title":"シーン 852","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStu