子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.498412698412698,"slideTitle":"スライド #1080","title":"シーン 1080","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1080_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1080.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「えっ？」私は、全く記憶にないことを指摘され、そう返す。","id":"DAB58E1D-2704-4C98-B7FF-666FB9ECBC59","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":4.498412698412698},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.448185941043084,"slideTitle":"スライド #1081","title":"シーン 1081","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1081_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1081.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"「その映像に映っている、お嬢様の様子をよく見ると、目から光が消えていて、その内容が報道されていたので…」","id":"9331ADE9-254B-4F6C-A998-B5D23B5C6425","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voiceDuration":6.448185941043084},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.060907029478457,"slideTitle":"スライド #1082","title":"シーン 1082","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1082_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1082.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"私は彼女に言われ、再び昨晩の記憶を思い起こす、だが、自室で彼とフランの行方に不安になっていたことしか思い出せない。","id":"EFF77760-4783-4918-870A-BB4CB9C13F47","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":8.060907029478457},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.981496598639456,"slideTitle":"スライド #1083","title":"シーン 1083","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1083_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1083.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"「それで、その報道を見た、パチュリー様や、美鈴がお嬢様に電話をかけても、応答がなかったので…」","id":"E07DFFA0-1480-4622-B97D-23BB3BFD8671","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voiceDuration":5.981496598639456},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":9.486984126984128,"slideTitle":"スライド #1084","title":"シーン 1084","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1084_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1084.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/困り顔小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"私は、紅茶を淹れたカップを咲夜とお姉様の前に出すと、二人がシーンと静まり返り、部屋には重たい空気が漂い始める。","id":"1571618A-D74E-4EFE-BCB2-860183F4544C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":9.486984126984128},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.556734693877551,"slideTitle":"スライド #1085","title":"シーン 1085","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1085_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1085.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「それで、私のことはどう呼んでいたの？」","id":"D664BB38-8019-4B94-A9BD-4D56F7C2CC56","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":2.556734693877551},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.603582766439909,"slideTitle":"スライド #1086","title":"シーン 1086","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1086_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1086.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"「今のところ、吸血鬼という正体は知られてませんが、知られるのは時間の問題で…、すぐにでも声明を出すべきかと…」","id":"93161EF3-0FEE-4810-BDEB-44E994A884F4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voiceDuration":6.603582766439909},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.610907029478458,"slideTitle":"スライド #1087","title":"シーン 1087","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1087_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1087.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「それに対する、学校側の反応は？」","id":"AE9FC2CF-FEEF-45A0-9A07-0AA192FB2D41","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":2.610907029478458},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.050997732426304,"slideTitle":"スライド #1088","title":"シーン 1088","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1088_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1088.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"「今月の頭にあった例の件を、沈静化させるために注力したから、今すぐに、その報道への対抗策は打てないかと…」","id":"F9CCF47C-DF6F-4C81-991C-A5F41E1234D9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voiceDuration":7.050997732426304},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.5436507936507935,"slideTitle":"スライド #1089","title":"シーン 1089","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1089_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1089.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「そう…、情報を知らせてくれてありがとう、咲夜…。」\n私は、動揺する自分を押さえ込みながら、そう彼女に言った。","id":"5BCA686B-83AD-499E-8D46-B529E1BE1A6C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":7.5436507936507935},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.1908843537414966,"slideTitle":"スライド #1090","title":"シーン 1090","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1090_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1090.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"「ところで、彼はどこにいるのでしょうか？」","id":"00752C79-2141-4E76-8999-D260DC6115FC","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voiceDuration":2.1908843537414966},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.911995464852608,"slideTitle":"スライド #1091","title":"シーン 1091","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1091_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1091.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/困り顔小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「彼なら、食器の片付けを済まして、図書館に向かったけど…」","id":"F885B409-DBEC-4556-9D35-9639EFA1BF7A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":4.911995464852608},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.746485260770975,"slideTitle":"スライド #1092","title":"シーン 1092","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1092_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1092.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"「そうですか…、では、これで失礼します。」私はそう言って、彼の元へ向かおうと動くと、お嬢様がそれを止める。","id":"92A2998B-96FC-45A2-A204-A488A012B3E2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voiceDuration":6.746485260770975},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.6248979591836736,"slideTitle":"スライド #1093","title":"シーン 1093","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1093_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1093.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「ちょっと待って、彼にどんな用事があるの？」","id":"96FE2DD5-912D-41D8-88C0-0C681C5DA948","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":2.6248979591836736},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.448888888888889,"slideTitle":"スライド #1094","title":"シーン 1094","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1094_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1094.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"「昨日、彼が校門を出ると、フランお嬢様の車に乗ったので、その確認ために、彼を連れ出すよう、学校に言われてまして…」","id":"CB308695-ACA8-437D-87D3-4FF7D3CA9CB5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voiceDuration":7.448888888888889},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.0478231292517,"slideTitle":"スライド #1095","title":"シーン 1095","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1095_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1095.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「そう、ならいいわ。」私は、なんとなく嫌な予感を感じながらも、そう、落ち着いた態度で、彼女にそう返すのだった。","id":"5C3D5F35-E210-4622-AD1F-CDD6112BCAE2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":8.0478231292517},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.762607709750567,"slideTitle":"スライド #1096","title":"シーン 1096","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1096_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1096.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕が、一人図書館で読書をしていると、彼女が声をかけてくる。\n「どうしたんですか？」","id":"814F0C20-CC2E-43AC-9492-B9FBFE52E1D6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":5.762607709750567},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.5500907029478457,"slideTitle":"スライド #1097","title":"シーン 1097","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1097_十六夜咲夜.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1097.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_53C6","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","telop":"「実は、大学病院から藤原さんに来てほしいと言われまして…」","id":"07965DDB-CB0B-4E82-9F5A-313A920DDE63","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜","voiceDuration":3.5500907029478457},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.995215419501133,"slideTitle":"スライド #1098","title":"シーン 1098","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1098_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1098.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですか…、ちょっと待っててください、この本を閉まってきますから。」僕はそういうと、本を閉じ、元の棚に戻す。","id":"C441D7D3-1E42-4796-BE80-1B0DA168715C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.995215419501133},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/