ides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1462.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ頬照り不満.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、強引に僕が持っている受話器を奪う。\n僕は、仕方なく、入浴の準備を済ませて、浴室に入った。","id":"8EAA493E-4E7A-4C0F-B0D4-F167E10C44F8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":10.684784580498865},{"animationDuration":1.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"スライド #1463","title":"シーン 1463: 彼が入浴を終えると…","animationName":"なし","bgmVolume":0.65,"animationNote":"表示時間：1.5秒","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"単色背景","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1463.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼が入浴を終えると…","id":"CFC0C92E-EFE3-463D-97F6-CBE7B6FB4E2C","seVolume":1},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.310430839002268,"slideTitle":"スライド #1464","title":"シーン 1464","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1464_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1464.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照りジト目あわわ.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕が、入浴と着替えを済ませて、出てくると、彼女は、フランとの電話を終えたのか、こっちをじっと見てくる。","id":"7