B2-4925-4560-B1C6-41E8216F61B7","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":2.53},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.255238095238095,"slideTitle":"スライド #1467","title":"シーン 1467","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1467_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1467.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「なら、私の質問に答えなさい。」","id":"342E27B0-43F5-4785-B08F-B2A51280DFCB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":3.255238095238095},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.547369614512471,"slideTitle":"スライド #1468","title":"シーン 1468","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1468_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1468.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、僕に関することをいろいろ聞いてきた。両親のことや、前の学校、そして最後にフランとの関係について。","id":"1989BAFC-099D-4EC3-A62C-82D703E02781","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.547369614512471},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":10.075668934240364,"slideTitle":"スライド #1469","title":"シーン 1469","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1469_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1469.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「あなたのことが、よく分かったわ。とりあえず、向こうに折り返しの電話を、かけなさい。聞きたいことがまだあるから。」","id":"4D8CF30C-045D-497E-B64F-36CED0363634","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":10.075668934240364},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.247369614512472,"slideTitle":"スライド #1470","title":"シーン 1470","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1470_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1470.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、受話器を取ると、フランたちの家電にかけてもらい、その後彼女が、フランたちに長電話をしていた。","id":"BAA6F407-FECC-48DC-B668-2CE04CA0BE7B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.247369614512472},{"animationDuration":1.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"スライド #1471","title":"シーン 1471: 一方、さとりとアリスの部屋では…","animationName":"なし","bgmVolume":0.65,"animationNote":"表示時間：1.5秒","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"単色背景","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1471.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","telop":"一方、さとりとアリスの部屋では…","id":"505933A4-157C-4769-9780-5CAD912D9B99","seVolume":1},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image65.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.328185941043084,"slideTitle":"スライド #1472","title":"シーン 1472","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1472_古明地さとり.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1472.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_C52B","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"私は、暇つぶしにテレビを見ていると、ある速報が流れる。\n私は、その速報を見ると、妹の部屋に向かう。","id":"77B29DFD-59AF-4786-8C43-E2103A668ACA","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voiceDuration":6.328185941043084},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":10.307732426303854,"slideTitle":"スライド #1473","title":"シーン 1473","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1473_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1473.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"私が、長電話を終えて、はぁーとため息をついていると、姉が私たちの部屋に入ってくる。「もう情報が出回ってるの？」","id":"051E0953-D76D-486E-91A2-996D1C0E9480","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":10.307732426303854},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.078185941043084,"slideTitle":"スライド #1474","title":"シーン 1474","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1474_古明地さとり.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1474.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_C52B","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「ねぇ、こいし。テレビで流れている内容は本当なの？」","id":"FAB89D77-EB2B-4CD3-B049-E6C44565FE27","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voiceDuration":3.078185941043084},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":10.43342403628118,"slideTitle":"スライド #1475","title":"シーン 1475","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1475_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1475.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ええ、そうよ。本当は彼には関係ない、内部事情だったけど…、状況が打って変わって、彼も関係者になったの。」","id":"9E37542F-0DBA-4644-929C-D677F1FF7660","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":10.43342403628118},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.4000907029478458,"slideTitle":"スライド #1476","title":"シーン 1476","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1476_古明地さとり.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1476.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_C52B","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「それって、どういうこと？」","id":"D2EDEF8A-FCE7-4BC0-B5A1-9F7DB30DAFC0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voiceDuration":1.4000907029478458},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.636462585034014,"slideTitle":"スライド #1477","title":"シーン 1477","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1477_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1477.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「彼が…、私の裸を見たのよ…」\n私は、羞恥心を堪えながら、姉にそう返す。","id":"0F358D5D-BFCF-4318-B90A-385E20C8766C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":7.636462585034014},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":0.98859410430839,"slideTitle":"スライド #1478","title":"シーン 1478","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1478_古明地さとり.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1478.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/さとり（驚く）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_C52B","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「それ本当なの…？」","id":"E899A492-F65E-425F-8758-DD518F5330C1","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voiceDuration":0.98859410430839},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":11.65578231292517,"slideTitle":"スライド #1479","title":"シーン 1479","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1479_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1479.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/さとり（驚く）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ええそうよ…、しかも、確定ではないけど、彼には副人格があって、その人格のときに、某建設会社の嬢の許嫁になるって…」","id":"DE569372-9455-4E40-A454-9B7088EE7420","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":11.65578231292517},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.9209977324263035,"slideTitle":"スライド #1480","title":"シーン 1480","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1480_古明地さとり.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1480.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_C52B","characterName":"古明地さとり","telop":"「ねぇ、もっと詳しい話を聞かせてくれない…、これは私とあなたの将来と私たちのグループに関わる出来事だから…」","id":"06BE14F0-7038-4B65-9325-5354F4C9D895","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voiceDuration":5.9209977324263035},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image60.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":11.26766439909297,"slideTitle":"スライド #1481","title":"シーン 1481","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1481_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1481.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ええ。」私は、彼が私の裸を見るまでは…、ただ甘えたい時に甘えられていた…、だが今となっては、それは過去の話だった。","id":"999CA9D0-95B6-4916-9956-22841989D3A4","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":11.26766439909297},{"animationDuration":1.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.5,"slideTitle":"スライド #1482","title":"シーン 1482: 一方彼は…","animationName":"なし","bgmVolume":0.65,"animationNote":"表示時間：1.5秒","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"単色背景","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1482.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","telop":"一方彼は…","id":"C661575E-90C3-4CFB-810C-60012DDF3FF0","seVolume":1},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.9039002267573695,"slideTitle":"スライド #1483","title":"シーン 1483","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1483_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1483.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女が長電話をする中、なんとなく気まずくなり、\n部屋を出て、夜の国際通りを歩いていた。","id":"161210BA-1CEA-4BB9-A06F-DB8787577814","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.9039002267573695},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.0973696145124716,"slideTitle":"スライド #1484","title":"シーン 1484","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1484_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1484.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、しばらく歩いていると、ある予感がする。","id":"8A2AB17D-7511-42D7-8248-C9BF2B951FE6","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.0973696145124716},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image67.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.063242630385487,"slideTitle":"スライド #1485","title":"シーン 1485","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1485_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1485.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、僕は国際通りから少し離れた屋台が立ち並ぶ場所に来た。そして、屋台の間の通路を歩き進んでいく。","id":"5BAF05A7-C628-42C4-8BC4-1A55047E4E65","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.063242630385487},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image67.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.094126984126984,"slideTitle":"スライド #1486","title":"シーン 1486","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1486_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1486.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、見事にその予感は当たり、頬照り、困った様子で、生ビールとおつまみらしきものを嗜む彼女の姿があった。","id":"D52D6C1B-7350-4B13-A05E-328FC9008F8E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.094126984126984},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image67.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.586507936507936,"slideTitle":"スライド #1487","title":"シーン 1487","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1487_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1487.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（驚く）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、彼女は僕の存在に気がついたのか、驚いた表情をする。","id":"E81A2970-2794-4D08-A708-5A4162753529","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":4.586507936507936},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image67.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.5147619047619045,"slideTitle":"スライド #1488","title":"シーン 1488","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1488_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1488.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「どうしたの…、紅夢くん…、高校生が来る場所じゃないわよ、ここは…、何か困ったことでもあったの？」","id":"9510375F-C948-4105-8C77-CCA233420880","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.5147619047619045},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image67.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.499546485260771,"slideTitle":"スライド #1489","title":"シーン 1489","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1489_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1489.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「アリスさん、その生ビールは何杯目ですか？」僕は、ジョッキグラスの半分ほど残っている、生ビールを見て言う。","id":"D5C3228D-4B38-40BE-AB1E-AD60702B55B9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.499546485260771},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image67.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.63,"slideTitle":"スライド #1490","title":"シーン 1490","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1490_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1490.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そんなことは、どうだっていいのよ…、それより彼女たちはどうしたのよ…、ここにいないならホテルにいるのでしょ？」","id":"ADC622A4-E7D0-44EE-BCE8-6F0838C15D9E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.63},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image67.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.419115646258504,"slideTitle":"スライド #1491","title":"シーン 1491","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1491_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1491.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女がそう言うと、カウンター越しに、お店の人が驚いた様子で僕を見る。僕は、慌てて首を横に振り、あることを聞く。","id":"B80858E7-C408-4BE8-9260-1F8DEAFB25F5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.419115646258504},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image67.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.1604308390022675,"slideTitle":"スライド #1492","title":"シーン 1492","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1492_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1492.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「彼女が飲んでいるお酒は、今何杯目ですか？」","id":"724A0CD0-034C-4729-8D70-179925F641B8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.1604308390022675},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image67.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.191950113378685,"slideTitle":"スライド #1493","title":"シーン 1493","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1493_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1493.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕がそう聞くと、その人は、ひっそりと指を立てる。\nその指は3本だった。僕は、それで価格に見当がつく。","id":"C86EB5A6-FC33-44B9-89F8-08C6742C9057","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.191950113378685},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image67.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.788684807256236,"slideTitle":"スライド #1494","title":"シーン 1494","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1494_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1494.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、部屋から背負ってきたバックから財布を取り出す。\n「代金は、3000円ですよね…？」","id":"0D4B3795-D053-4684-805E-25BB89705FBE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":5.788684807256236},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image67.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.345215419501134,"slideTitle":"スライド #1495","title":"シーン 1495","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1495_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1495.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、その人は驚いた様子をするが、\nハッと気を取り直し、お金を受け取り、笑って見せた。","id":"F6B8EFB9-08A6-49AB-B9D2-72047EAEBD65","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.345215419501134},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image67.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.588684807256236,"slideTitle":"スライド #1496","title":"シーン 1496","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1496_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image67.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1496.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ほら、帰りますよ…、アリスさん…。」僕は、そう言い彼女の手を取る。彼女は、特に手間取ることもなくそのまま歩き出す。","id":"D91A8BDA-7EF3-4491-8341-2441165E7EEB","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.588684807256236},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.119115646258503,"slideTitle":"スライド #1497","title":"シーン 1497","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1497_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1497.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、そのまま彼女と手を繋いだ状態で、その通りを通る。\n僕は、ふと彼女が、せんべろに行った理由を尋ねる。","id":"055E09B7-C56B-4381-ABD7-AEB7579431D2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.119115646258503},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.2778231292517006,"slideTitle":"スライド #1498","title":"シーン 1498","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1498_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc283172_商店街（夜）.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1498.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「アリスさんは、なんで屋台村なんかに行ったんですか？」","id":"F62C088E-C6C0-4D6A-92C3-2C15925C0C0A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.2778231292517006},{"voice2StartTimeOffset":1.9073922902494331,"telop":"「そんなの…、自分に素直になって、あなたに甘えるためじゃない…、このバカ…」","seVolume":1,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/アリス（困る）.png","voiceDuration":1.9073922902494331,"voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2DB3","animationName":"なし","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常