":"「もういい、あんたに私の気持ちを分からせるわ。」","id":"7A3E3BEA-CF6C-4364-A69A-488E82AF6A39","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":3.8270521541950115},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.421292517006803,"slideTitle":"スライド #1947","title":"シーン 1947","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1947_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1947.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、彼女の突如の変化に戸惑いながらも、そっとキスをする。","id":"940A14EF-8BD0-45D3-BCC4-B3D690107EF8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":4.421292517006803},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.225646258503401,"slideTitle":"スライド #1948","title":"シーン 1948","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1948_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1948.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ頬照り赤らみ驚き.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、彼女の全身が頬照ったように赤みを帯び、固まってしまう。僕は、その彼女の手を取り、ある存在を示す。","id":"D9370A62-E945-4281-81B2-11E5C92FC733","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.225646258503401},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.486507936507936,"slideTitle":"スライド #1949","title":"シーン 1949","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1949_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1949.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ頬照り赤らみ怒り.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、彼女はますます赤く染まっていき、僕を押し倒したことを疑うくらいになっていた。だが、彼女は強烈なビンタをする。","id":"328C9F6F-4BB8-4543-B0F9-961944D8DF6F","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.486507936507936},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.197233560090703,"slideTitle":"スライド #1950","title":"シーン 1950","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1950_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1950.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ頬照り赤らみ怒り.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「あんた、今まで私を騙してたの！」","id":"EA9410A8-DCC6-49C0-BACE-7CED54E60799","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":3.197233560090703},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.30607709750567,"slideTitle":"スライド #1951","title":"シーン 1951","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1951_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1951.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ頬照り赤らみ怒り.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「いえ、僕は戸籍上は男ですが、医者からは生まれつき、女性と男性、双方の臓器や体の部位があるって言われたんです。」","id":"C676BFAB-A2A6-4FE7-9AA8-52E415BBC26E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.30607709750567},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.567392290249433,"slideTitle":"スライド #1952","title":"シーン 1952","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1952_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1952.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ頬照り赤らみ不満.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「何、それどういうこと？あんたは男と女、どっちなの？」","id":"5B6029DC-B86E-434F-B2BE-A0B8A46DBF26","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":5.567392290249433},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.714761904761905,"slideTitle":"スライド #1953","title":"シーン 1953","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1953_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1953.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ頬照り赤らみ不満.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「性別の判断基準は分かりませんが、僕は小さい頃から男として今まで、生きてきましたよ、記憶の限りでは。」","id":"91CEFC6F-2577-4A6F-9C14-52395C274B75","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.714761904761905},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.003854875283447,"slideTitle":"スライド #1954","title":"シーン 1954","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1954_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1954.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ふぅん…、まぁいいわ…、\nあなたを奪うことには変わりはないのだから。」","id":"1C5C0377-9715-47E2-89FC-4AB1EAC77125","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":5.003854875283447},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.843628117913832,"slideTitle":"スライド #1955","title":"シーン 1955","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1955_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1955.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/頬照り小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「それでどうしますか、このままいきますか？\n僕は、特殊な体つきなので、子どもはできないですけど。」","id":"52E374FD-9F19-469B-8679-6B95973F9778","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":8.843628117913832},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.9473696145124717,"slideTitle":"スライド #1956","title":"シーン 1956","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1956_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1956.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ頬照り赤らみ驚き.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると彼女は再び赤らみを帯びて、驚く。","id":"E8300A82-8174-4EB3-B28A-33A9BBD8957B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":2.9473696145124717},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":9.503854875283446,"slideTitle":"スライド #1957","title":"シーン 1957","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1957_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1957.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ頬照り赤らみ不満.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「そんなことどうだっていいわ、あなたが私をその気にさせたんだから。何かあっても、絶対に責任とってよね。」","id":"47D7C822-69EA-4D69-98FE-4BD0807C831B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":9.503854875283446},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.3484580498866214,"slideTitle":"スライド #1958","title":"シーン 1958","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1958_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"01B9D6C4-260F-54BA-9FEC-5D178E103F22.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1958.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ頬照り赤らみ不満.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女はそういうと、無理やり僕の服を脱がすのだった。","id":"A04EF022-AE51-4F3D-B25E-9F47043A221C","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.3484580498866214},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.108253968253969,"slideTitle":"スライド #1959","title":"シーン 1959","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1959_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1959.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「んっ…」僕は、ふと目が覚めると、窓から光が差し込んでいた。\n僕は、ふと動こうとすると、違和感に気がつく。","id":"B449E82C-344B-4963-B644-2ED593A46AFE","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.108253968253969},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.65281179138322,"slideTitle":"スライド #1960","title":"シーン 1960","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1960_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1960.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ寝顔.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、ふと隣を見ると、そこにはすやすや眠るこいしの姿があった。だが、僕はすぐに違和感の正体を知る。「裸…」","id":"9F3FE971-B188-4E81-B812-0918AE524B81","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.65281179138322},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":0.5,"slideTitle":"スライド #1961","title":"シーン 1961","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1961_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1961.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ第三の目なし寝起き顔.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「ん…」","id":"30B7A1BD-F68D-4315-84A4-908D38E24654","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":0.5},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":0.5,"slideTitle":"スライド #1962","title":"シーン 1962","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1962_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1962.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ頬照り第三の目なし怒り.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「あなた昨晩のこと、どこまで覚えているの？」\n制作ソフト及び協力\nGemini\nTohoStuido","id":"F22387E0-48B1-4906-A5A1-DCA93E3F8868","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":0.5},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.162607709750567,"slideTitle":"スライド #1963","title":"シーン 1963","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1963_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1963.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ頬照り第三の目なし怒り.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女は、目が覚めると、縛るように抱きつき、そう聞いてくる。\n「昨日、こいしさんに襲われるまで、全部覚えてますけど…」","id":"9067EA48-37DA-4CED-81B9-F18C70B7E8F6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.162607709750567},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.420975056689342,"slideTitle":"スライド #1964","title":"シーン 1964","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1964_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1964.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ頬照り第三の目なし怒り.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「まぁ、いいわ。私がいいと思うまで、このままにしなさい…」","id":"FF1218DA-4A90-4EBA-9716-E9C2134FECD6","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":5.420975056689342},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.345215419501134,"slideTitle":"スライド #1965","title":"シーン 1965","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1965_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"2026-10-25_16-14.pxd","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1965.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/パジャマ頬照り第三の目なし怒り.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕はそれから、フランが部屋の扉を開けるまでの間、ずっと彼女に抱きしめられていた。そして、それを見たフランは絶叫した。","id":"19795868-19E9-4F38-AF8E-0FDA411519CE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.345215419501134},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.921292517006803,"slideTitle":"スライド #1966","title":"シーン 1966","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1966_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1966.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから、僕は服を着て食堂に来ると、\nそこには頬照った状態で、怒りの表情を見せる3人がいた。","id":"30FA0C5F-FBD2-4D33-B9A8-98B5678DCC56","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.921292517006803},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.7819954648526077,"slideTitle":"スライド #1967","title":"シーン 1967","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1967_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1967.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「紅夢は一体、どういうつもりなの？」","id":"D626AF8A-8BA1-4A99-9652-87BC764E2B12","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":2.7819954648526077},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.390861678004535,"slideTitle":"スライド #1968","title":"シーン 1968","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1968_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1968.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「こいしさんが突然恋人の有無を聞いてきて、あの部屋がフランとの二人部屋だって言うと、ムキになって襲ってきたので…」","id":"6864FC71-0954-46A8-9CEA-FCBAE6D9D4F0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.390861678004535},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.244489795918367,"slideTitle":"スライド #1969","title":"シーン 1969","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1969_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1969.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「私が聞きたいのは紅夢の意見だよ。事実じゃない。」","id":"00FFCD3C-35E9-48F8-98BA-525DAF7CC553","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":4.244489795918367},{"voice2StartTimeOffset":3.5571655328798184,"telop":"「意見って…、僕はさっきそれを含めて話したんですが、\nもっとわかりやすく言うなら、僕はフランさんが…」","seVolume":1,"characterName":"操夢","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voiceDuration":3.5571655328798184,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","animationName":"なし","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"スライド #1970","bgmVolume":0.65,"duration":6.40453514739229,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1970.jpeg","id":"26DDB315-FA2D-4007-9FAB-2FB62A6380CE","voice2Character":"操夢","voice2AudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1970_操夢_2.wav","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2Duration":2.8473696145124716,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1970_操夢.wav","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 1970"},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.2517233560090704,"slideTitle":"スライド #1971","title":"シーン 1971","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1971_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1971.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕がそこまでいうと、こいしが驚いた表情をする。","id":"99C764E8-871F-40D6-8565-380122F97653","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.2517233560090704},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.2939002267573696,"slideTitle":"スライド #1972","title":"シーン 1972","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1972_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1972.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「それじゃあ、私は好きじゃないって言うの？」","id":"F9396F5A-2E45-4FC4-A8A8-1E7C220FFA9A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":3.2939002267573696},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.243038548752835,"slideTitle":"スライド #1973","title":"シーン 1973","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1973_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1973.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「『好き』と言う言葉の解釈が違うかもしれませんが、\n僕はこいしさんは恋人というよりかは、妹だと思いますよ。」","id":"5D946243-9358-4B44-B011-DFF9C8AE96C8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.243038548752835},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.6930385487528343,"slideTitle":"スライド #1974","title":"シーン 1974","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1974_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1974.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕の発言に、こいしが再び驚く。","id":"A82A0945-6AD9-444C-877A-BBFB152C7E02","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":2.6930385487528343},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.134331065759637,"slideTitle":"スライド #1975","title":"シーン 1975","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1975_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1975.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"だが、彼女は表情を変えて、\n僕の方にくると、強烈な平手打ちをする。","id":"9A11FEA2-17C3-4EE4-93B4-C5D969BC7167","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":5.134331065759637},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.5591156462585034,"slideTitle":"スライド #1976","title":"シーン 1976","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1976_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1976.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「もう、あんたのことなんかは知らないんだから！」","id":"F880B602-4958-40E1-BE75-3958DC1D92E2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":3.5591156462585034},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.07891156462585,"slideTitle":"スライド #1977","title":"シーン 1977","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1977_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1977.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女そう激昂すると、食堂を走って出て行った。僕は、\n彼女の後を追いかけようとすると、フランが僕の手を掴む。","id":"C57E79AB-64F4-4D9C-A4A0-21765A52E3D8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.07891156462585},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.760430839002267,"slideTitle":"スライド #1978","title":"シーン 1978","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1978_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1978.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「あの…あのまま外に出たら、\nまた襲撃されそうですが、いいんですか？」","id":"78D88075-734E-4553-839E-A550BE6E4500","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":4.760430839002267},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.856077097505669,"slideTitle":"スライド #1979","title":"シーン 1979","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1979_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1979.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「食堂を出る前に、一言、私に言ったらどうなの？」","id":"77A89A28-D0FD-489C-8D8C-87E3BB2CA2A2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.856077097505669},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.077823129251701,"slideTitle":"スライド #1980","title":"シーン 1980","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1980_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1980.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「さっき言いかけた言葉に続きをつけるなら、フランさんが僕の初恋ですが、正直に言えば、それは明確な答えじゃないと…」","id":"34C7DE82-A402-4074-8A17-D7CA1A0F5D20","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.077823129251701},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.8430385487528347,"slideTitle":"スライド #1981","title":"シーン 1981","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1981_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1981.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（驚く）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕がそう言うと、二人は驚きの声をあげる。","id":"AA7F8843-19EA-463E-906D-B42BCDC38AB3","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":2.8430385487528347},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.725646258503401,"slideTitle":"スライド #1982","title":"シーン 1982","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1982_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1982.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（不満）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、フランは僕の頬をビンタし、レミリアが話し出す。","id":"A26BCF7B-0ACD-4EF0-9151-A495D3A3D0C0","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.725646258503401},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.373401360544218,"slideTitle":"スライド #1983","title":"シーン 1983","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1983_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1983.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「あなた、言われないと相手の気持ちが分からないの？少しくらいは指摘されずとも、相手の気持ちを理解できたらどうなの？」","id":"4465529D-9654-4FEE-88B0-DB83D508BFDD","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":7.373401360544218},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.424126984126984,"slideTitle":"スライド #1984","title":"シーン 1984","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1984_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1984.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（不満）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「えっ？ でも、これまでの人生では、勉強しているだけで、相手の気持ちなんか考えなくても問題などなかったんですが…」","id":"29148C18-EC3E-4B81-B428-027083E85E61","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.424126984126984},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.033242630385487,"slideTitle":"スライド #1985","title":"シーン 1985","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1985_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1985.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「まぁ、さっきの発言は聞かなかったことにするから、\nあなたはもっと…、こう、なんて言うのかしら…」","id":"907D4E3C-47FC-40A1-B712-29B17D6D40E8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":6.033242630385487},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":9.171995464852607,"slideTitle":"スライド #1986","title":"シーン 1986","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1986_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1986.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「私から言うのなんだけど、紅夢は乙女心っていうものを知るべきだと思うよ。ただ、本読んだり勉強だけするんじゃなくて。」","id":"3098BAB6-F661-4D7A-8EC4-A3753E0A4102","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":9.171995464852607},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.788684807256236,"slideTitle":"スライド #1987","title":"シーン 1987","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1987_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1987.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「乙女心ですか…」僕はしばらく考えるが、ふと思い出す。「それより、先にこいしを探して、見つけ出さないと…」","id":"4D3C47F8-016D-4649-8B21-3D5D8C1932B8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.788684807256236},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.5165759637188208,"slideTitle":"スライド #1988","title":"シーン 1988","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1988_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1988.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（驚く）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"私は、ふと気がつくと、彼は食堂を離れて行った。","id":"2EF94892-39EC-4102-A260-2E2182D63E26","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":3.5165759637188208},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.831746031746032,"slideTitle":"スライド #1989","title":"シーン 1989","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1989_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1989.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「フラン、これからするべきことは分かってるわね。」","id":"3C3147F1-BF2A-4ECA-B855-D5426A19F5F9","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":2.831746031746032},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.059478458049886,"slideTitle":"スライド #1990","title":"シーン 1990","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1990_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1990.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「分かってるよ、お姉様。彼に分からせないと…」","id":"AFF5CC6D-14CF-4BAB-8042-81BA7A794E8D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":4.059478458049886},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.837981859410431,"slideTitle":"スライド #1991","title":"シーン 1991","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1991_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.1991.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「とりあえず、彼への教育を考えないとね…」","id":"582CCB86-5350-4B9E-B9DE-106BF4F80795","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":2.837981859410431},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.270748299319728,"slideTitle":"スライド #1992","title":"シーン 1992","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1992_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/key