_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2053.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/永琳（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「感想って言われても…、\n飲んだ直後に意識が飛んじゃったので、覚えてないです…。」","id":"8697DC3D-25A3-46FF-96FE-FC5C1184ED3A","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":4.993038548752835},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc166698_病院の診察室.png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.503401360544218,"slideTitle":"スライド #2054","title":"シーン 2054","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2054_八意永琳.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc166698_病院の診察室.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2054.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/永琳（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_F1CA","characterName":"八意永琳","telop":"「そう…、それでさっきまで見てた夢は分かるかしら？」","id":"A3FD6BF9-E3B4-4D74-810E-AFCABC7F386D","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"八意永琳","voiceDuration":3.503401360544218},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc166698_病院の診察室.png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.599546485260771,"slideTitle":"スライド #2055","title":"シーン 2055","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2055_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc166698_病院の診察室.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\