e_2071_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc256897_病室-夕方-電気あり.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2071.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/こいし（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"彼女は、突如病室の扉を開け、僕にそう言ってくる。「そうですか…、分かりました。」僕はそう言い、ゆっくりと体を起こす。","id":"D8305FA7-9133-4CD8-AF49-37B62E338960","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.823469387755102},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image79.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.571292517006802,"slideTitle":"スライド #2072","title":"シーン 2072","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2072_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image79.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2072.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/こいし（微笑）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕たちが、校門から出てくると、フランが驚いた様子で、車から降りてきた。「どうしたんですか、フランさん？」","id":"45CB4E51-496C-40EF-A833-916510ECE5AE","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.571292517006802},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image79.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":1.106984126984127,"slideTitle":"スライド #2073","title":"シーン 2073","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2073_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image79.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2073.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「手を見なさい！」","id":"3D9B7233-EB62-410D-B5C7-88969DB02002","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":1.106984126984127},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image79.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.519115646258504,"slideTitle":"スライド #2074","title":"シーン 2074","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2074_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image79.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2074.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/こいし（余裕）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「こいしさんが、こうしたい言ったから、\n単純に手を繋いでいるんですけど…」","id":"E96A921E-A22A-4D83-A06E-D97087AF24E2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":4.519115646258504},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image79.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.360430839002268,"slideTitle":"スライド #2075","title":"シーン 2075","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2075_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image79.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2075.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/こいし（余裕）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、単純にそう説明する。ふと、隣を見ると、こいしがニヤついていた。だが、ある嫌な目線を僕は感じる。","id":"1FAAE746-3AE4-4677-8559-3AC9C78295CF","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.360430839002268},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image79.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.532154195011338,"slideTitle":"スライド #2076","title":"シーン 2076","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2076_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image79.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2076.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/さとり（余裕影）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、僕の視線に気がついたのか、彼女がこちらに駆け寄ってくる。そして、彼女はポッケを探るようにする。","id":"48C3ADBA-7553-474D-9555-F3309A232084","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.532154195011338},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image79.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.938684807256235,"slideTitle":"スライド #2077","title":"シーン 2077","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2077_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image79.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2077.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/さとり（余裕影）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、彼女はナイフを取り出す。僕が、反射的にこいしの前に立つ。すると、僕の体にナイフが突き刺さる。「うっ…」","id":"AB806DA8-3CDF-46ED-B256-58DC76497375","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.938684807256235},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image79.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.493038548752834,"slideTitle":"スライド #2078","title":"シーン 2078","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2078_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"image79.jpeg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2078.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/影付き恐怖顔.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、瞬間的に状況を把握し、残っている力を込めて、こいしにいう。「こいしさん、フランさんと車で帰ってください！」","id":"A331A31C-CEB8-4D8A-8F95-909D861D2D44","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.493038548752834},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/image79.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffse