・スカーレット","voiceDuration":10.321995464852607},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.4973696145124715,"slideTitle":"スライド #2109","title":"シーン 2109","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2109_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2109.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「じゃあ、母の神社はどうなるんですか？」","id":"7AFA1F9D-8320-4742-B1E3-9BF79089F6C5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":2.4973696145124715},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.371315192743765,"slideTitle":"スライド #2110","title":"シーン 2110","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2110_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2110.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「あなたの母については、私たちが選出した後継ぎを向こうに送るから、安心しなさい。それと、学校の了承も得てるから。」","id":"C53E35A6-7933-49B6-BDEC-22816C26F65E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":8.371315192743765},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.475646258503401,"slideTitle":"スライド #2111","title":"シーン 2111","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2111_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2111.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですか…ならいいですけど…」僕は、\n三人の説明を聞き終えると、そう言いながらハンコを押した。","id":"8EC238B7-FF63-4940-979A-9628CD92D6A5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.475646258503401},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":9.002380952380953,"slideTitle":"スライド #2112","title":"シーン 2112","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2112_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2112.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"あれから、長い年月がたち、あっという間に、僕は卒業式を迎えた。すると卒業生代表のスピーチで僕の名前が呼ばれる。","id":"F4A75CB3-2341-442F-9861-8A8B6DF2E4A3","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":9.002380952380953},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.947369614512471,"slideTitle":"スライド #2113","title":"シーン 2113","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2113_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2113.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、僕は卒業生を代表したスピーチのために壇上を上がる。\n卒業生の列にさとり、そしてこいし、保護者席にフランがいた。","id":"F154EE93-18F2-4CB7-8B65-3835337EBCCF","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.947369614512471},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.821292517006803,"slideTitle":"スライド #2114","title":"シーン 2114","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2114_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2114.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"そして、僕はそれから卒業生代表のスピーチを読み上げる。","id":"A1A309C3-8A93-4A38-92E0-8B5D8DC9E743","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.821292517006803},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.439773242630386,"slideTitle":"スライド #2115","title":"シーン 2115","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2115_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2115.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"スピーチが終わると、僕は席に戻り、卒業式が続くのだった。","id":"E17EF755-03BF-47C3-8D6D-2C6382B8F274","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":4.439773242630386},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":8.390861678004535,"slideTitle":"スライド #2116","title":"シーン 2116","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2116_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2116.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"それから卒業式を終えた僕たちは、教室に戻る。そして僕は、担任からの一言と終礼が終わると、校門に向かう。","id":"739FEFA5-A7F5-4655-B40C-CEBD5295083E","seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.390861678004535},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":7.307165532879819,"slideTitle":"スライド #2117","title":"シーン 2117","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2117_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2117.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/泣き笑い.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕が校門を出ると、そこには頬が赤らみ、涙を見せるフランの姿があった。「なんで、泣いているんですか。」","id":"149E2367-F28C-4AC1-A415-ED2C97E69803","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.307165532879819},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.396984126984127,"slideTitle":"スライド #2118","title":"シーン 2118","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2118_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2118.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/涙目頬照り小口笑い.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_1A94","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","telop":"「仕方ないじゃん、感動してたら、自然に溢れてきたの。」","id":"4D760671-683A-40D0-BE1D-A41981BECCE8","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":4.396984126984127},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.98,"slideTitle":"スライド #2119","title":"シーン 2119","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2119_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2119.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/涙目頬照り小口笑い.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「そうですか…、とりあえず、帰りませんか？」\n僕がそう聞くと、彼女は頷き、僕たちは帰宅する。","id":"7FEE8CA1-683B-432F-9D55-4B5D5CC7314E","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.98},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":6.058253968253968,"slideTitle":"スライド #2120","title":"シーン 2120","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2120_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2120.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/後ろ手笑い.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕とフランが帰宅すると、レミリアに呼び出される。\nすると、二人が祝福の言葉を述べる。","id":"563C7A84-129D-49D7-9FAA-1A712BFEF559","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.058253968253968},{"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「卒業おめでとう！」","seVolume":1,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット&古明地こいし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/後ろ手笑い.png","voiceDuration":1.2546485260770974,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","animationName":"なし","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"スライド #2121","bgmVolume":0.65,"duration":1.6530385487528345,"backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2121.jpeg","id":"71105CB9-6EBA-4767-A6E0-615FE7851339","voice2Character":"古明地こいし","voice2AudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2121_古明地こいし.wav","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2Duration":1.6530385487528345,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2121_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 2121"},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.556077097505669,"slideTitle":"スライド #2122","title":"シーン 2122","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2122_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2122.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/後ろ手笑い.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"「ありがとうございます。」僕は、二人にそう返す。","id":"2BF2FD1D-BD4F-413B-B6C5-F6F0EDE4235B","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.556077097505669},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.80390022675737,"slideTitle":"スライド #2123","title":"シーン 2123","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2123_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2123.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/驚き.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"すると、二人の頬が一気に頬照る。「どうしたんですか…？」","id":"03BA25B0-2051-458F-B228-3E9437226853","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.80390022675737},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":2.2254875283446713,"slideTitle":"スライド #2124","title":"シーン 2124","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2124_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2124.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/赤面小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","telop":"「あなた、その微笑みはずるいわよ…」","id":"CA2FB5E1-A852-42D7-8AEF-1C8C54A937D5","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceDuration":2.2254875283446713},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.028707482993197,"slideTitle":"スライド #2125","title":"シーン 2125","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2125_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2125.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/赤面小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_2B53","characterName":"古明地こいし","telop":"「そんな微笑みを、突然見せられたら、欲しくなっちゃうじゃん…」","id":"AFCACF8C-1BDE-407F-845C-CFA17F6FC036","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","voiceDuration":5.028707482993197},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.145215419501134,"slideTitle":"スライド #2126","title":"シーン 2126","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2126_操夢.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2126.jpeg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常総集編\/赤面小口開け.png","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterName":"操夢","telop":"僕は、二人のその反応に、思わず「ふっ」と笑いが漏れる。","id":"2AC973AA-6030-47B0-94E1-503093D79135","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":4.145215419501134},{"voice2StartTimeOffset":1.3171655328798186,"telop":"「笑わないでちょうだい…、まったくそういうところなのよ…」","seVolume":1,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（怒る）.png","voiceDuration":1.3171655328798186,"voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット","audioTrack":"track_voice_char_30CA","animationName":"なし","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"スライド #2127","bgmVolume":0.65,"duration":2.8947392290249434,"backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7\/元女子校の日常総集編_6ce7fe1ac7.2127.jpeg","id":"F69E2374-56EB-47D1-B86C-F910552AFADB","voice2Character":"レミリア・スカーレット","voice2AudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2127_レミリア・スカーレット_2.wav","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2Duration":1.5775736961451248,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2127_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 2127"},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.661315192743764,"slideTitle":"スライド #2128","title":"シーン 2128","animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_2128_古明地こいし.wav","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","slideImage